;==== if Chamber Cooling is necessary ====


M145 P1 ; set airduct mode to heating mode for heating
M106 P2 S127 ; turn on 50% filter fan
M142 P6 R30 S40 U0.3 V0.8 ; set PLA/TPU exhaust chamber autocooling


